@startuml cpp_standard_features
title MicroLA C++ Standard Feature Progression

skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "C++17 (Baseline - Required)" <<Rectangle>> #E6FFE6 {
    component "Core C++17 Features" as cpp17
    note right of cpp17
        • if constexpr (compile-time branches)
        • constexpr with loops and locals
        • inline variables
        • structured bindings

        **MicroLA Usage:**
        SIMD path selection
        Optimized code generation
        Zero runtime overhead
    end note
}

package "C++20 Features" <<Rectangle>> #FFF0E6 {
    component "Modern Features" as cpp20
    note right of cpp20
        • Concepts:
          - Arithmetic<T>
          - FloatingPoint<T>
          - Integral<T>
        • MICROLA_BIT_CAST (std::bit_cast)
        • consteval (MICROLA_CONSTEVAL)

        **MicroLA Usage:**
        Type-safe templates
        Branch optimization
        Safe type punning
        Compile-time validation
        (stack-size config check)
    end note
}

package "C++23 Enhancements" <<Rectangle>> #FFE6F3 {
    component "MICROLA_IF_CONSTEVAL" as cpp23
    note right of cpp23
        • if consteval (MICROLA_IF_CONSTEVAL)

        **MicroLA Usage:**
        Dual compile/runtime paths
        Optimized constexpr detection
    end note
}

package "C++26 (Latest)" <<Rectangle>> #F0E6FF {
    component "MICROLA_CONSTEXPR_TRIG" as cpp26
    note right of cpp26
        • constexpr math functions:
          - std::sin, std::cos
          - std::sqrt, std::atan2

        **MicroLA Usage:**
        Compile-time rotations
        Compile-time vector/quaternion norms
        Compile-time Euler extraction
        Arbitrary angle matrices
        Full constexpr transformation

        **Example:**
        constexpr auto rot =
          Mat<float,2,2>::rotation(45°);
    end note
}

cpp17 -down-> cpp20 : Adds
cpp20 -down-> cpp23 : Adds
cpp23 -down-> cpp26 : Adds

note as FeatureDetection
    **Automatic Feature Detection:**

        C++17 is the required baseline.
        Feature detection starts at C++20:
        #if __cplusplus >= 202002L  // C++20
        #if __cplusplus >= 202302L  // C++23
        #if __cplusplus >= 202600L  // C++26

    Features automatically enabled
    based on compiler __cplusplus value
end note

@enduml

